ong_description": "Transform your industrial workforce training with the AryaXR Scaffolding VR Application - the definitive virtual reality simulation built for heavy industry, construction, and engineering teams. Designed to align with rigorous global safety standards, this application drops trainees directly onto a virtual job site to experience high-consequence scenarios with zero real-world physical risk.\n\nKey Training Modules & Features:\n-> Step-by-Step Assembly: Learn the precise sequence for erecting scaffolding structures, ensuring stable structural validation logic from the ground up.\n-> Component Identification: Master the correct identification and placement of standards, ledgers, transoms, couplers, and toe-boards.\n-> Dual Learning Modes: Build foundational knowledge in an interactive Practice Mode, then validate skills under pressure in Test Mode.\n->Performance Analytics: Track execution times and procedural accuracy instantly to measure trainee readiness.\n\nEquip your team with the muscle memory and confidence required to identify critical structural defects before they ever step onto a real job site.", "short_description": "Master tower scaffolding erection with zero risk. The AryaXR Scaffolding Training Simulator offers a safe VR environment to learn critical, high-risk procedures. Build your foundational knowledge in Practice Mode, and then put your skills to the test in Test Mode to gain real-world confidence."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aryaxr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ARYAXR AI SOLUTIONS (OPC) PRIVATE LIMITED", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://aryaxr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED